  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Survival 5 ranks, Navigation sphere (Tracking Expert).</p>\n<p>When you successfully track a creature, you may spend 1 use of skill leverage to receive a clear mental image of the creature. The image has the exact same appearance as the creature that made the footprint at the moment it made the imprint, including any telling features or expressions, any gear or equipment, or anything else the creature was carrying at the time. For example, the footprint of a horse would reveal both the horse and any creature riding it when it made the footprint.</p>\n<p>If you possess the analyze ability of the Investigation sphere, you may analyze the image as if it were the original creature.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/navigation#toc66\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
